OL,3,GNEWSALeader wants to scrap climate
OL,4,Aemergency declaration
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservative leader of a
OL,7,FLeicestershire council has said he
OL,8,Fwants to scrap its declaration of a
OL,9,Fclimate emergency.
OL,11,FSimon Whelband said Harborough District
OL,12,FCouncil had been wrong to adopt the
OL,13,Fmove in 2019 which later led to the
OL,14,Fauthority setting a target of becoming
OL,15,Fnet-zero by 2030.
OL,17,FWhelband had been among the Tory
OL,18,Fcouncillors who voted in favour of the
OL,19,Fdeclaration at the time, but said he
OL,20,Fnow believed such language was
OL,21,Falarmist.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
