OL,3,GNEWSALeader wants to scrap climate
OL,4,Aemergency declaration
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpposition councillors said the council
OL,7,Fleader was arguing against "clear"
OL,8,Fscience and that his proposal was a
OL,9,F"sop for the right".
